{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And the festival of harvest.</b> A time of joy, as it is written: ״They rejoice before You with the joy of harvest, as they exult when they divide spoil.\"" "<b>That you sow.</b> You are the one sowing in the field of the master; therefore you bring the first fruits as the tax of the land, and the Holy One, blessed be He, is the master who gives it to His servants." "<b>And the festival of gathering.</b> When a person gathers all his fruits, then he is joyful; and when you perform the joy in accordance with My commandments, then the festival is לשמי, for My name." "<b>At the going out of the year.</b> And another year enters."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:02.116554529Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}